"<strong><b>Project App</b>:</strong> Plan and execute complex marketing "
"campaigns with task lists, Kanban\n"
"        boards, and milestones to keep your team on deadline.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບໂຄງການ (Project App)</b>:</strong> ວາງແຜນ ແລະ "
"ດຳເນີນແຄມເປນການຕະຫຼາດທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນດ້ວຍລາຍການໜ້າວຽກ, ກະດານ Kanban\n"
"        ແລະ ຈຸດໝາຍຫຼັກ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທີມງານຂອງທ່ານເຮັດວຽກທັນຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ.<br/>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Social Marketing App</b>:</strong> Manage social media campaigns "
"for multiple clients from one\n"
"        central dashboard, scheduling posts and tracking engagement."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການຕະຫຼາດສື່ສັງຄົມ (Social Marketing App)</b>:</strong> "
"ຈັດການແຄມເປນສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍສຳລັບລູກຄ້າຫຼາຍຄົນຈາກໜ້າຕ່າງດຽວ,\n"
"        ກຳນົດເວລາໂພສຕ໌ ແລະ ຕິດຕາມການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Subscriptions App</b>:</strong> Manage recurring revenue streams "
"for retainer clients, automating\n"
"        monthly invoicing and renewal management."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ (Subscriptions App)</b>:</strong> "
"ຈັດການລາຍຮັບຕໍ່ເນື່ອງສຳລັບລູກຄ້າແບບປະຈຳ, ສ້າງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ປະຈຳເດືອນ\n"
"        ແລະ ຈັດການການຕໍ່ອາຍຸໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Timesheets App</b>:</strong> Track time spent on client projects "
"effortlessly, ensuring accurate\n"
"        billing for hourly work and better resource planning.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບບັນທຶກເວລາ (Timesheets App)</b>:</strong> "
"ຕິດຕາມເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນແຕ່ລະໂຄງການຂອງລູກຄ້າຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ, ຮັບປະກັນການຄິດໄລ່ເງິນ\n"
"        ສຳລັບວຽກລາຍຊົ່ວໂມງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍວາງແຜນຊັບພະຍາກອນໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ.<br/>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>:</strong> Showcase your agency's portfolio and "
"case studies with a professional,\n"
"        easy-to-update website that attracts new business."
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ (Website App)</b>:</strong> ສະແດງແຟ້ມຜົນງານ ແລະ "
"ກໍລະນີສຶກສາຂອງບໍລິສັດທ່ານ ດ້ວຍເວັບໄຊທີ່ມີຄວາມເປັນມືອາຊີບ,\n"
"        ອັບເດດງ່າຍ ແລະ ດຶງດູດໂອກາດທາງທຸລະກິດໃໝ່ໆ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong>: Gain complete financial visibility with "
"integrated bookkeeping, financial reporting, and tax management."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong>: ເບິ່ງເຫັນພາບລວມທາງດ້ານການເງິນຢ່າງຄົບຖ້ວນ ດ້ວຍລະບົບບັນຊີ, "
"ລາຍງານການເງິນ ແລະ ການຈັດການອາກອນທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Appointment</strong>: Manage appointments synchronised with your "
"calendar in a few clicks with the Appointment App."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການນັດໝາຍ</strong>: ຈັດການການນັດໝາຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບປະຕິທິນຂອງທ່ານພາຍໃນບໍ່ເທົ່າໃດຄລິກ "
"ດ້ວຍແອັບນັດໝາຍ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.ir_ui_view_1840
msgid "<strong>Artistic Direction</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການກຳກັບສິລະປະ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.ir_ui_view_1840
msgid "<strong>Audit</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການກວດສອບ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automate Reporting</strong>: Schedule automated reports for clients "
"showing campaign performance, hours worked, and project progress."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລາຍງານອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong>: ຕັ້ງເວລາສົ່ງລາຍງານອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າ "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງປະສິດທິພາບແຄມເປນ, ຊົ່ວໂມງເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງໂຄງການ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>CRM App</strong>: Track leads and opportunities in a visual "
"pipeline, ensuring you never miss a\n"
"        potential client pitch or follow-up."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ແອັບ CRM</strong>: ຕິດຕາມຜູ້ມີທ່າແຮງ ແລະ ໂອກາດໃນຂັ້ນຕອນການຂາຍທີ່ເຫັນພາບໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ, "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ທ່ານບໍ່ພາດ\n"
"        ການສະເໜີວຽກ ຫຼື ການຕິດຕາມລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_4
msgid "<strong>Celebrate Success, Strategize for Growth</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ສະເຫຼີມສະຫຼອງຄວາມສຳເລັດ, ວາງຍຸດທະສາດເພື່ອການເຕີບໂຕ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.ir_ui_view_1840
msgid "<strong>Conception</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການສ້າງແນວຄວາມຄິດ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Create Service Packages</strong>: Bundle services into packages "
"(like \"Brand Launch\" or \"Digital Presence\") to streamline your sales "
"process and upsell clients."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສ້າງແພັກເກດການບໍລິການ</strong>: ລວມການບໍລິການເຂົ້າເປັນແພັກເກດ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"\"ເປີດໂຕແບຣນ\" ຫຼື \"ການສ້າງຕົວຕົນໃນໂລກດິຈິຕອນ\") ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຂາຍສະດວກຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມຍອດຂາຍໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Deliverables:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງສົ່ງມອບ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_4
msgid "<strong>Event Flow:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ລຳດັບຂັ້ນຕອນງານ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_1
msgid "<strong>Event Schedule:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ຕາຕະລາງງານ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_2
msgid "<strong>Harness the Power of Authentic Influence</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ນຳໃຊ້ພະລັງແຫ່ງອິດທິພົນທີ່ແທ້ຈິງ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Helpdesk</strong>: Provide exceptional client support with ticket "
"tracking, SLAs, and knowledge bases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (Helpdesk)</strong>: ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອລູກຄ້າຢ່າງດີເດັ່ນ "
"ດ້ວຍການຕິດຕາມບັນຫາ, ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງລະດັບການບໍລິການ (SLA) ແລະ ຄັງຄວາມຮູ້."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Included in Scope:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ລວມຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດວຽກ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Integrate Everything</strong>: Link your CRM opportunities to "
"projects, timesheets to invoices, and subscriptions to recurring services "
"for a seamless workflow."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເຊື່ອມໂຍງທຸກຢ່າງເຂົ້າກັນ</strong>: ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂອກາດ CRM ເຂົ້າກັບໂຄງການ, "
"ໃບບັນທຶກເວລາເຂົ້າກັບໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້, ແລະ ການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກເຂົ້າກັບການບໍລິການຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ "
"ເພື່ອຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຄ່ອງຕົວ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Leverage Subscriptions</strong>: Convert project clients to retainer "
"relationships using the Subscriptions app for predictable revenue."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ນຳໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກການສະໝັກສະມາຊິກ</strong>: ປ່ຽນລູກຄ້າລາຍໂຄງການມາເປັນລູກຄ້າປະຈຳ "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ແອັບ Subscriptions ເພື່ອສ້າງລາຍຮັບທີ່ຄາດການໄດ້."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Marketing Automation</strong>: Create sophisticated nurture "
"campaigns for your own agency's lead generation."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong>: ສ້າງແຄມເປນຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ດູແລລູກຄ້າທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ "
"ເພື່ອຊອກຫາຜູ້ມີທ່າແຮງໃຫ້ແກ່ບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Master the Channel that Drives Your Growth</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ເປັນເຈົ້າຂອງຊ່ອງທາງທີ່ຂັບເຄື່ອນການເຕີບໂຕຂອງທ່ານ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_3
msgid "<strong>Masterclass Experience:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ປະສົບການມາສເຕີຄລາສ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:sale.order.template,note:marketing_agency.sale_order_template_4
msgid "<strong>Not Included:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ບໍ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນຂອບເຂດວຽກ:</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Purchase</strong>: Manage freelancers and subcontractors with "
"purchase orders and vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຈັດຊື້</strong>: ຈັດການຜູ້ຮັບຈ້າງອິດສະຫຼະ ແລະ ຜູ້ຮັບເໝົາຕໍ່ ດ້ວຍໃບສັ່ງຊື້ ແລະ "
"ໃບບິນຈາກຜູ້ສະໜອງ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Recruitment</strong>: Find and hire top creative talent with "
"applicant tracking and interview management."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການສັນຫາບຸກຄະລາກອນ</strong>: ຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຮັບສະໝັກບຸກຄະລາກອນສ້າງສັນຊັ້ນນຳ "
"ດ້ວຍລະບົບຕິດຕາມຜູ້ສະໝັກ ແລະ ການຈັດການການສຳພາດ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:marketing_agency.ir_ui_view_1840
msgid "<strong>Social Media</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາຍ</strong>"

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_2
msgid ""
"<strong>The Masterclass Experience:</strong>\n"
"This hands-on training takes place in a creative studio environment where "
"theory meets practice. You'll analyze successful case studies, participate "
"in platform-specific breakout sessions, and develop a customized influencer "
"strategy blueprint for your brand. Our expert instructors bring insights "
"from managing influencer campaigns across diverse industries and budget "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ປະສົບການມາສເຕີຄລາສ:</strong>\n"
"ການຝຶກອົບຮົມຕົວຈິງນີ້ຈັດຂຶ້ນໃນສະຕູດີໂອສ້າງສັນ ບ່ອນທີ່ທິດສະດີປະສານກັບການປະຕິບັດ. "
"ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ວິເຄາະກໍລະນີສຶກສາທີ່ປະສົບຜົນສຳເລັດ, ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມກອງປະຊຸມຍ່ອຍສະເພາະແຕ່ລະແພລດຟອມ ແລະ "
"ພັດທະນາແຜນຍຸດທະສາດອິນຟລູເອັນເຊີສະເພາະສຳລັບແບຣນຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ວິທະຍາກອນຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານຂອງພວກເຮົານຳເອົາຄວາມຮູ້ຈາກການຈັດການແຄມເປນອິນຟລູເອັນເຊີໃນຫຼາກຫຼາຍຂະແໜງການ "
"ແລະ ງົບປະມານ."

#. module: marketing_agency
#: model_terms:event.event,description:marketing_agency.event_event_4
msgid ""
"<strong>The Showcase Experience:</strong>\n"
"Hosted in an elegant setting, the Results Showcase combines insightful "
"presentations with interactive discussions. We transform complex data into "
"clear visualizations that tell the story of your marketing performance. The "
"event culminates in a collaborative planning session where we identify key "
"initiatives for the coming quarter."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ປະສົບການງານສະແດງຜົນງານ:</strong>\n"
